{"_id":"68a736358ec3d8323af1ddd2","nodeId":"fusu4ZHH4-cjoouLr4F9U","roadmapSlug":"rust","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:07:32.844Z","description":"# WebAssembly (WASM)\n\nWebAssembly is a binary instruction format that runs at near-native speed in web browsers and other environments. Rust compiles excellently to WASM with tools like `wasm-pack` and `wasm-bindgen`, enabling high-performance web applications and cross-platform deployment.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Embedding WebAssembly in your Rust Application","url":"https://blog.wasmer.io/executing-webassembly-in-your-rust-application-d5cd32e8ce46","_id":"6a7f4b36cb44947debcfdcfd"},{"type":"official","title":"wasm-pack","url":"https://lib.rs/crates/wasm-pack","_id":"6a7f4b36cb44947debcfdcfe"},{"type":"official","title":"wasm-bindgen","url":"https://docs.rs/wasm-bindgen/latest/wasm_bindgen/","_id":"6a7f4b36cb44947debcfdcff"},{"type":"article","title":"Writing & Compiling WASM in Rust","url":"https://www.shuttle.dev/blog/2024/03/06/writing-wasm-rust","_id":"6a7f4b36cb44947debcfdd00"},{"type":"article","title":"Compiling from Rust to WebAssembly","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/WebAssembly/Guides/Rust_to_Wasm","_id":"6a7f4b36cb44947debcfdd01"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:07:02.070Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/rust/content/fusu4ZHH4-cjoouLr4F9U.md"}